WEBVTT

00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:19.160
Hear me out! Sorane's in trouble!

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:20.580
Again?

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:25.160
Did something suspicious show up
the shadows of one of her blog pictures?

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.540
No... Wait. What do you mean by that?

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.000
That's scary!

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.750
Ever since the thing with Sorane,
I've been worried.

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.250
Maina posted this in her blog...

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:39.450
"Bean curd refuse was so cheap
at the supermarket today!"

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.580
Could those clothes in
the background belong to a man?!

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:45.830
Or something.

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.500
Just the fact that she's using
a blue plate made me think...

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.200
Oh! This must be a guy's place!

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:55.660
I even end up looking in the mirrors to see
if I can see who took the pictures!

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:58.830
Even if it's a selfie,
I look for people's shadows!

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:01.330
I even up the brightness of every picture

00:01:01.330 --> 00:01:04.500
and then zoom in to see if there's
anyone reflecting in her eyes.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.790
I'm completely neurotic!

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.910
This hurts so much...

00:01:09.910 --> 00:01:13.950
I almost wish she'd stop
uploading pictures to her blog.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:17.080
I somehow wonder why I was even worried now.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:20.120
So what happened with Sorane?

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:22.660
Oh, right.

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:27.410
Apparently, the clothes I bought for her
had a matching guy version, and...

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.910
...people seem to think she got
a matching outfit with her boyfriend.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:34.790
I see.

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.410
There you go, looking like you don't
care about other people's faves again!

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:40.830
Then why don't you buy that outfit

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:42.620
so you can match with her?

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.330
Oh, I see.

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:47.330
There's still time before the show starts.

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:49.540
I'm gonna go buy it right now!

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.250
Everyone bought the matching outfit...

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.750
"I Want You in My Future"

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:44.750
I'm only going to post completely
nude photos from now on...

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.160
That'd cause even more trouble.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.700
More importantly,
are you Googling yourself again?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:53.410
No. I was looking up how to take care of moles.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:04.660
Reo-<i>chin</i>, Reo-<i>chin</i>, there's a free
10-pull <i>gacha </i>a day starting today!

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:07.080
Morning.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:07.950
Good morning.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.450
"Aren't A-ya and Sorane acting weird lately?"
"Pretty sure they never got along."
"Maybe they're fighting over a guy~"

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.660
Good morning.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.450
Good morning.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:20.450
Aya!

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:25.620
What?

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.870
I'm okay with you not liking me,
but people are always watching us.

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:35.540
Just remember we have to look like we get along.

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.370
People are watching us?

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:41.200
People are tweeting, saying we don't get along.

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:47.790
Why is Sorane's ranking higher than me
when there's a rumor about her and some guy?

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:53.250
I know why you don't like me,

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:55.870
and there's nothing I can do
if you don't believe me.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:00.950
But let's do our best
at the concert again today!

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:01.950
Huh?

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:05.830
It's already winter.

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.200
When I think of winter... I think of <i>sundubu</i>.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:10.620
Yeah, <i>sundubu</i>!

00:05:10.620 --> 00:05:12.040
Really?

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:16.000
Sorane, your emceeing is weird as usual.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:20.580
You see... I've got plans with Aya
to go have some dinner.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.700
Huh?!

00:05:21.700 --> 00:05:22.700
Right?

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:29.000
O-Oh, yeah... After lessons tomorrow...

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.540
Aya-<i>chin</i>, you promised me you'd
be having dinner with me tomorrow.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:35.500
All three of you could go, you know?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.040
True...

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:38.660
Oh, snap... We could.

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:41.000
Uh... I want to go, too.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.950
I-I do, too.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.580
Then we should all go together. You, too, Maina.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:47.040
S-Sure...

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.500
Actually, listen to this.

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:51.500
Aya gave me some indoor socks the other day.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.080
I'll upload it to my blog sometime soon.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.000
Sorane's a pro...

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:01.790
It's beginning to look a lot like Christmas.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:05.080
Do either of you have plans Christmas?

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.080
Ch-Christmas plans?!

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.080
Why would you ask an <i>otaku </i>that?

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:12.830
I'm sure he didn't mean any harm.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.580
Huh?

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:17.950
I took off both Christmas Eve
and Christmas like I do every year.

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:20.410
So that I could make plans at any time.

00:06:20.410 --> 00:06:23.620
You're taking time off even though
you don't have set plans yet?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:28.950
In my case, I want to spend it
with the person I love the most,

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:33.160
so I'm going to be busy, without a doubt!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:36.910
Eripiyo! That's no fair! That's betrayal!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.120
We spend every Christmas together!

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:47.700
Oh, so that's it.
You're going to the Christmas concert.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:49.040
Correct!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.870
Don't scare us like that.

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:56.290
Why would I make plans to go anywhere
other than the concert on Christmas?

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:59.200
I'm only going to the concert
next year and the year after that, too.

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.200
So you're going to be spending it with
Maina next year and the year after that.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:05.000
Actually, I can't see a future without Maina!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:11.200
I wonder if all the Cham girls
are going to wear Santa outfits.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.120
Of course. And there'll be photo ops, too.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:16.290
They're going to be insanely adorable!

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:20.120
Yes. Reo last year was beyond cute.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.620
Must be nice being you guys.

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:25.080
Maina wasn't wearing one last year.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:27.000
Wait, just Maina?

00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.950
She had on a Santa hat...

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:32.120
...and the photo op was the same as usual.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:36.250
I'm sure she's just embarrassed.

00:07:36.250 --> 00:07:39.370
She doesn't seem to do very well with those.

00:07:39.370 --> 00:07:42.120
Actually, in my opinion...

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:43.120
Yes?

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:45.410
It's nothing!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:50.290
It's nothing at all! See you guys next week!

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:51.700
Eripiyo!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.040
You were in the middle of saying something!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:08:00.250
I'm sure she just didn't have enough money
last year to buy a Santa outfit.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:05.040
So if I support her even more this year,
that'll end up being some money for her to use,

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.870
and she'll be able to buy
a super-cute and hyper-amazing outfit!

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.080
I mean... I don't actually know what'll happen.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:14.080
But if other <i>wotas </i>find out about this,
they'll also work hard,

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:16.540
and then they'd all end up
in super-cute outfits.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:20.200
Even though I'd be supporting her,
Maina wouldn't stand out as much.

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.700
And so... it's a secret!

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.000
"ChamJam Christmas Concert"

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:32.200
Our Christmas concert's finally been announced.

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.200
Right?

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.370
Will you guys come see us?

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.870
It'll be a full house!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:38.870
Hello.

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:42.700
We're meeting for the first time... right?

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:43.830
Yeah.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:46.000
So like...

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:47.080
I'm stupid, right?

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:48.290
Huh?

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.370
I'm terrible at remembering people's faces.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.250
So...

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:55.500
If you come all the time,
I'll start remembering you.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.370
Okay, I will.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.000
What do you think?

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:02.660
Do you think you can do that, Maina?

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.040
N-No way...

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.370
Yeah, I figured.

00:09:05.370 --> 00:09:09.290
Maina and Yumeri,
your handshake sessions are starting.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.750
--Oh, okay.
--Okay.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.910
What are you doing, Aya?

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:39.200
I always wanted to become an idol,
so I was pretty confident.

00:09:40.250 --> 00:09:42.000
And yet...

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.700
Sorane, who just randomly joined,
managed to become more popular than me.

00:09:45.700 --> 00:09:47.910
Management was supporting her,

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.330
and she was great with handling the fans.

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:54.660
But... Even then, Sorane...

00:10:01.330 --> 00:10:05.040
The guys you manage to lure in
are guys who really fall for you.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.500
I was a bit jealous.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:10.700
Uh... I wasn't trying to lure anyone in...

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:16.580
I don't have any <i>wotas </i>that are the type
to really fall in love with me!

00:10:16.580 --> 00:10:18.750
I don't have any heavy <i>wotas</i>
that would stray from you

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.200
if there were any rumors
that you had a boyfriend.

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:35.660
This isn't something only I can do.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:40.540
I hope you like me forever.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.830
Just kidding.

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:49.790
Th-There's no way I could do that!
What the heck was that?!

00:10:49.790 --> 00:10:52.250
No wonder they fall for you.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.450
So can we be friends?

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:56.450
I mean...

00:10:56.450 --> 00:10:59.370
It's not like we were fighting.

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:08.580
Huh?

00:11:08.580 --> 00:11:10.830
This many on a regular day?

00:11:11.450 --> 00:11:12.950
"Eel"

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:14.450
Why?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:16.250
"Safety First"
Why...?

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:20.910
I wanted to see you in your adorable
Santa outfit, so I went all out!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.120
But that'd probably sound creepy
if I told her that.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:28.540
Because I want you in my future, Maina.

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:33.120
Next year and the next...

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:35.370
I want to spend every Christmas with you, Maina.

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:38.250
And I want you to wear cute outfits.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.580
Um, I...

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.250
I ended up saying it anyway...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:49.250
Even the top of her head is cute.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:51.200
Thank you very much!

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.450
See you later!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.000
Eripiyo...

00:12:05.000 --> 00:12:06.830
"Christmas Sale"

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:07.830
Reo!

00:12:09.330 --> 00:12:11.250
Sorry! Did I keep you waiting long?

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.290
No.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.120
Wow, there're so many.

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.000
Right? Doesn't it make you excited?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.080
So you're wearing one this year, right?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:32.160
Huh?

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:33.620
A Santa costume.

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:36.450
Yeah.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:39.040
Even though you were so embarrassed last year?

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.450
Yeah.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:44.410
I'm still embarrassed,

00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:47.580
but the fans will watch me in it.

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.200
Isn't it nice?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:52.580
There're so many other
happy things going on that day,

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:56.120
but we have fans who come to see us.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:13:00.120
Yeah. It makes me happy. Really happy.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:15.830
That one's good.

00:13:15.830 --> 00:13:17.540
So is that one.

00:13:17.540 --> 00:13:19.160
That one would look great on her, too.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:26.160
Okay! Mental training complete!

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.620
Now I won't get a nosebleed
even if I see Santa Maina in person.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:48.200
Crap. I cut my bangs too short. This sucks.

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.620
--Hey, why don't we buy matching rings?
--Ooh, good idea. Where should we get them?

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:56.200
Man, I'm so jealous.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.120
What are you talking about?!

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:02.500
We're also spending Christmas Eve
with the people we love.

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.790
Yeah!

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:05.450
Just the fact that we're spending Christmas Eve

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.450
with them is basically
just like going out with them!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.580
O-Of course!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:12.450
Today, we get to have our Christmas date.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.700
We sure do!

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.540
It's getting dark over there...

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.290
You mean your heart?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.700
No!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:25.500
Look over there. There are giant storm clouds.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:30.620
I don't really know,
but the concert space is underground,

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:34.410
so we probably don't have to worry.

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:38.410
Yeah! Let's hurry to our Christmas dates!

00:14:38.410 --> 00:14:41.750
We shouldn't keep the ones we love waiting.

00:14:41.750 --> 00:14:42.790
Yeah!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:05.620
Welcome to our Christmas concert!

00:15:05.620 --> 00:15:08.580
You guys! It's Christmas! Were you bored?

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.330
Yuka!

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:12.040
Don't say things like that.

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:16.160
Ma...

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.540
Ma...

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.500
...i...

00:15:22.620 --> 00:15:23.660
...na!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:34.160
Maina's an adorable little Santa Claus!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.580
Good for you.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.950
Santa Maina!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:41.950
The best present I could ask for is the fact
that you were born into this world at all!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:45.620
I love you again today!

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:54.580
A power outage?

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:56.290
It's so dark...

00:15:56.290 --> 00:15:58.620
Was that lightning?

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.750
That was huge!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.120
No, no, no! I'm scared, I'm scared, I'm scared!

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.370
Maina! Don't move!

00:16:06.370 --> 00:16:07.330
Huh?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:12.040
It's dangerous to move around too much!
All of you! Including the staff.

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:15.700
Eripiyo... Can you actually see
in this darkness?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.250
No, but I can feel it.

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:19.200
You...

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.120
You can feel it?

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.370
I'm gonna turn on a light.

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:33.250
I figured this was the only way
to get a photo op with Santa Maina.

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:37.500
Because I totally believed you'd
wear the Santa outfit this year!

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.290
Guys, stay calm.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:47.790
Okay, now... light up those King's Blades!

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:51.660
O-Of course.

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:52.830
I guess we could do that!

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:53.830
Okay.

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:12.910
Be careful.

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:16.410
Reo, are you okay?

00:17:16.410 --> 00:17:18.910
Yes, thank you.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.660
All of you be careful, too, okay?

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:22.080
Okay!

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:25.040
Yume, look out for the cord there.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.540
Yeah. My eyes are getting used to it.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.000
It's dark. It's scary.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:31.950
You've got this A-ya!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:33.330
Are you scared, Yuka?

00:17:33.330 --> 00:17:37.040
Nah, I'm fine. I'm walking just fine
and making a weird face.

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.120
Why?!

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:42.330
We're almost at the exit! Just a little more.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:43.700
Okay!

00:17:51.040 --> 00:17:53.870
This is amazing...

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:57.870
I feel like I'm actually
helping Maina out right now.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:05.080
Because I want you in my future, Maina.

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:13.040
Even if my world ends up
pitch black in the future,

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:17.250
as long as I have Eripiyo's light,
I can continue walking.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:29.660
I... don't think I'll ever forget this view.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:33.660
We will now begin the photo ops!

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:41.620
They're so pretty. They look like candles.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.700
It really reminds me of Christmas.

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:46.410
You did a great job, Eripiyo.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:50.160
I think I might've been a reindeer
in my previous life.

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:52.000
We will now begin Maina's line.

00:18:54.370 --> 00:18:56.160
Great job today, Maina!

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:58.250
It must've been really hard today.

00:18:58.250 --> 00:19:02.540
No, no. You had it harder than anyone, Eripiyo.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.660
What? No way!

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.450
I didn't think it was rough even for a second.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:11.120
Actually, today's the most
satisfied I've felt this year!

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.000
All right. Let's start the photo op.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.370
Y-Yes, sir.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:32.330
M-Maina's way closer than usual!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.120
I-Is this a Christmas miracle?

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:44.750
Here we go. Okay, say, "Cheese."

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.500
Thank you so much today, everyone.

00:19:56.500 --> 00:20:01.120
This was a rather eventful Christmas,

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:05.330
but I'm happy we got to spend it together.

00:20:13.330 --> 00:20:18.290
Maina actually wore the Santa outfit this year.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:19.700
She looks super cute.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.250
This year...

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:28.160
No.

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.500
Next year, and the year after that,

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.950
I hope we're able to celebrate Christmas again.

00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:36.370
I...

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:40.080
...want to spend Christmas with
all of you in the future, too.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.540
And...

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:48.000
...I want Eripiyo in my future, too.

00:20:52.620 --> 00:20:55.160
"Bic Camera"

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.950
You seem happy, Eripiyo.

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:00.870
Santa and his reindeer...
That was the perfect combo!

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:03.950
I'm going to treasure this forever.

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.870
This is more unfortunate than usual...

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:14.620
Jealous, aren't ya?

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.120
There.

00:21:59.450 --> 00:22:05.500
If there's ever a day that
Eripiyo's world turns pitch black,

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:09.830
I want to be someone who can show her the way.

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.660
Th-This is...

00:22:16.950 --> 00:22:19.950
"It ended up being a white Christmas.
Maina"

00:22:20.790 --> 00:22:24.450
...a picture where I didn't have to try
to look for clues of a guy being around...

00:22:26.700 --> 00:22:29.500
You're so cute, Maina!

00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:33.910
You're so cute!

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:08.200
Now that Christmas is over,
it's time for the New Year's Eve concert!

00:24:08.200 --> 00:24:12.500
I get to spend the end of the year with Maina?!

00:24:12.500 --> 00:24:14.830
Do your best at the last concert
of the year, Maina!

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:18.200
I'll be cheering you on! I have so much to say!

00:24:18.200 --> 00:24:19.870
"Not as a Wota, but as a Person"
--Maina is just so--
--Thank you very much!
